---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <img
        src="/profile.jpg"
        alt="Harsh Gadodia"
        class="w-36 h-36 sm:w-48 sm:h-48 rounded-full mx-auto object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Harsh. I'm a software engineer from Singapore.
      </p>
      <p>
        I studied Computer Engineering at
        <a href="https://nus.edu.sg/" class="link link-primary" target="_blank">NUS</a>, where I was part of the
        <a href="https://nuscollege.nus.edu.sg/" class="link link-primary" target="_blank">University Scholars Programme</a>
        (now NUS College) — a interdisciplinary programme that let me pair engineering with courses on writing,
        social sciences, and global narratives. It shaped how I think about a lot of things. During my studies, I also interned as an iOS
        developer at
        <a href="https://www.getepic.com" class="link link-primary" target="_blank">Epic!</a>
        in the Bay Area.
      </p>
      <p>
        I later completed my MBA at
        <a href="https://quantic.edu/about/" class="link link-primary" target="_blank">Quantic</a>
        in 2024 and have been building mostly in software ever since.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not working, I'm usually running, reading, chasing good coffee, or plotting my next trip. I like being
        outdoors, long conversations, and working on building new things, especially with AI.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
